  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Knowledge exchange for Water Energy Food (WEF)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In this study tour, a maximum of 12 Algerian entrepreneurs involved with the water, energy and food sector are participating in the Africa Works! Conference in the Netherlands and the subsequent field visits with Dutch companies.The entrepreneurs will be inspired and learn from Dutch innovation and knowledge on the WEF sectors and Nexus. This should provide them with knowledge, skills and technologies they can apply in their businesses.Ultimately, this should enable them to respond to the green energy transition and growing demand of food in Algeria.</narrative>
  </description>
