     <actual value="1">
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">During the AW! Conference, which focused on the WEF nexus, the topic of green hydrogen has passed by which closely link to the new CERF programme in Algeria.. As part of the CERF programme, a scoping study will be implemented in September until December 2022 to map out the Algerian green hydrogen sector, to find potential opportunities for developing this sector, and to identify Dutch added value in the green hydrogen market in Algeria. This AW! conference has contributed to this study by exploring Dutch stakeholders in the green hydrogen sector.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
